{
  "description": "MG-018 verdict-parity corpus. Each case is a complete scene document staged into the shipped powerpoint_graphic fixture job; expected verdicts were probed against the shipped MG-007 validators (TypeScript validateJob and Python motion_contracts.py agree on every case). catalogCategory differs from shippedCategory only for reject-component-c06-unavailable, by design: the catalog has registered C06 by identity but cannot dispatch it yet (MG_CAPABILITY_UNSUPPORTED), while the contracts layer has not registered it at all (MG_UNKNOWN_COMPONENT). Accept/reject verdicts are identical on every case.",
